window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>'Together we stand and together we fall.' </p><p>Because this time, what is asked of the Chosen One, she cannot do alone. </p><p>Keira finds herself enlisting the help of her friends as she goes beyond the realms of sanity and steps into a world the likes of no other. </p><p>One that is filled with personal demons she has no choice but try and tame. Join our heroine as she must face the Fates head on and discover what it truly means to be the Electus. </p>"; 
